  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to support the analysis  dissemination of the 2023 Grenada Agricultural Census</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Government of Grenada with the analysis of census of agriculture, and data are disseminated according to international standards.   Provide Technical assistance with the data census used as a sampling frame to design a system of regular surveys, including crop and livestock surveys that are the main sources of primary data on food supply.</narrative>
